es: do their names, dates and other details fit together? Which fit what the other documents say? Does any document read as altered, or out of place? If the documents give no reason to prefer one answer, go by what you know.\n\nReply with JSON only, in this form:\n{\"reason\": \"one or two sentences\", \"choice\": \"A\"}"
